From: sardi-dev <134648583+sardi-dev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 21:47:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/25] Move taking mail money and items into Player

HandleMailTakeMoney and HandleMailTakeItem did their work inside the
handlers, tied to a mailbox and the packet results. Add Player::TakeMailMoney
and TakeMailItem, which return a MailResponseResult, and DeleteEmptyMail
to remove a mail once nothing is left in it. The handlers call them and
send the same results as before. A mail item that is not loaded no longer
reaches CanStoreItem as a null pointer.
